  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LONGITUDINAL RESEARCH IN AFAR AND SOMALI REGIONODI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODI is conducting longitudinal research to accompany Save the Children&#x2019;s (SC) programme &#x2018;&#x2018;Supporting Women and Girls in Ethiopia&#x2019;s lowlands to realise their rights and live healthy and productive lives, free from violence and abuse&#x2019;&#x2019; in six woredas in Somali and Afar regions. The purpose of the research is to assess the effectiveness of the SC programme strategy in contributing to a reduction in FGM/C and child marriage in Somali and Afar Regions and how the programme is responding to the National Coasted Roadmap to End Child Marriage and FGM/C by 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
